## POST-DEPLOY MANUAL ACTIONS REQUIRED

```bash
# 1. SES — Request production sending limit increase
aws ses put-account-sending-enabled --enabled

# 2. SES — Verify domain identity  
aws ses verify-domain-identity --domain fixyachips.com

# 3. Replace SSM origin secret with cryptographically strong value
aws ssm put-parameter \
  --name "/fixyachips/prod/origin-secret" \
  --value "$(openssl rand -hex 32)" \
  --type "SecureString" \
  --overwrite

# 4. Create CloudFront key pair for signed URLs
aws cloudfront create-key-group \
  --key-group-config Name=FixyachipsKeyGroup,Items=[YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY_ID]

# 5. DynamoDB Global Table — verify all 3 replica regions active
aws dynamodb describe-table --table-name FixyachipsStudents-prod

# 6. Lambda concurrency — request limit increase for viral events
# Default account limit is 1000 — request 10,000+ via Support

# 7. API Gateway — disable default execute-api endpoint
aws apigateway update-rest-api \
  --rest-api-id YOUR_API_ID \
  --patch-operations op=replace,path=/disableExecuteApiEndpoint,value=true
```

