User: this is the live template:   is this safe to leave up for a couple of days?   AWSTemplateFormatVersion: '2010-09-09'
Description: 'Fixyachips Global v4.1.2: Clean Deploy - Custom Domain, Dual WAF, Bot Control, Throttling, Budget Guard (Alarms removed temporarily)'

Parameters:
  AdminEmail:
    Type: String
    Default: 'info@fixyachips.com'
    Description: 'Email for admin notifications and budget alerts'

  CertificateArn:
    Type: String
    Default: 'arn:aws:acm:us-east-1:980049663300:certificate/f18b7918-a24d-4a36-bfe4-34a114d4ccaf'
