**What this means:**

```
Lambda permissions are tied to the function ARN.
If the function ARN changes (it won't here — no function replacement)
the permission needs to be replaced.

Since SignupWorker is Modify not Replace,
this should resolve as False at execution time.

But if FixyachipsMasterRole replacement causes Lambda
to get a new ARN (it won't — Lambda ARN is independent of role)
this could cascade.

Watch it. Low risk in this specific change set.
```

